Description:

Adds the Sieve "foreverypart" and "mime" extensions (RFC 5703), so that
scripts can loop over the MIME parts of a message and test the headers of
each part, e.g. to find a body part with "Content-Disposition: reaction"
(RFC 9078).


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

Changed: sieve_extensions (new values "foreverypart" and "mime", both
enabled by default)


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Existing compiled scripts continue to work, but bytecode compiled
by this version can't be run by older versions.


GitHub issue:

None.
